en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1015","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[44,33,75,83,74,61],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1010602","helmet":"WP1012702"},"couple":["WJ10779"]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[44,33,75,83,74,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1010602","helmet":"WP1012702"},"couple":["WJ10779"]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[44,33,75,83,74,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1010602","helmet":"WP1012702"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹操之女。年轻时被曹操嫁予荀彧长子荀恽嫁育有二子荀甝、荀霬，其子在曹魏备受礼遇。曹丕登基后封其为安阳公主。公主自幼爱好学术，有着与他人截然不同的气质，刚满十四岁时便熟读诸子百家的典籍，与其弟曹冲被世人称为曹家双麒，饱受赞誉。","tc":"曹操之女。年輕時被曹操嫁予荀彧長子荀惲嫁育有二子荀甝、荀霬，其子在曹魏備受禮遇。曹丕登基后封其為安陽公主。公主自幼愛好學術，有著與他人截然不同的氣質，剛滿十四歲時便熟讀諸子百家的典籍，與其弟曹沖被世人稱為曹家雙麒，飽受贊譽。","en":"A daughter of Cao Cao. In her youth, she was married to Xun Yun, the eldest son of Xun Yu, and bore two sons, Xun Han and Xun Yi, both of whom received great courtesy under Cao Wei. After Cao Pi's accession, she was enfeoffed as Princess of Anyang. The princess had loved scholarship from childhood and possessed a temperament that set her apart from her peers. By the age of fourteen, she had already mastered the works of the Hundred Schools, and alongside her younger brother Cao Chong, she was praised by the world as the Twin Qilins of the Cao family.","jp":"曹操の娘。若くして父の命により荀彧の長男・荀惲に嫁ぎ、荀甝と荀霬の二子をもうけた。息子たちは曹魏において厚遇された。曹丕が即位すると安陽公主に封じられた。公主は幼少より学問を好み、常人とは一線を画す気品を備えていた。わずか十四歳にして諸子百家の典籍に通じ、弟の曹沖とともに世の人々から「曹家の双麒」と称えられ、高い賛辞を受けた。","kr":"조조의 딸이다. 젊은 시절 조조의 명으로 순욱의 장남 순운에게 시집가 두 아들 순감과 순익을 낳았으며, 아들들은 조위에서 극진한 예우를 받았다. 조비가 제위에 오른 후 안양공주에 책봉되었다. 공주는 어려서부터 학문을 좋아하여 남다른 기품을 지녔으며, 갓 열네 살이 되었을 때 이미 제자백가의 전적을 두루 통달하여 동생 조충과 함께 세상 사람들로부터 '조가의 두 기린'이라 불리며 많은 칭송을 받았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10966","remark":"","surname":"曹","surnameTc":"曹","surnameEn":"Cao","surnameJp":"曹","surnameKr":"조","surnameOther":"","name":"璇","nameTc":"璇","nameEn":"Xuan","nameJp":"璇","nameKr":"선","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"曹璇","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"207","city":"CS1026","gender":"1","rule":"44","force":"33","wise":"75","politics":"83","charm":"74","will":"61","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"12/12/12/12/12/82/57/12","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1017702;1011102","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012505","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"1100","debateSoulPoint":"5600","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001505","professions":"0/0/0/1/3/0/0/2/3/3/0/0/0/1/0/3/2/0/0/4/2/0/2/1","attribute2":"49/36/85/92/74/68","morality":"4","compatible":"15","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"195","show":"207","death":"250","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"4","weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1010602","helmet":"WP1012702","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;8/1;15/1;27/1;37/1;42/1;60/1;36/0;39/0","father":"WJ10001/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"WJ1029215/100;W